    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-σκαρθμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαίρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-springing, bounding,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.814
			</span></i>; or (as expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.8.6
			</span></i>), <i>driving swift horses,</i> but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὄνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					350
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					5.657
				</span></i>
			.</div>
